# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the URL.
# .env.local is git-ignored, so the URL never leaks to GitHub.
#
# How to get the URL:
#  1. Open https://script.google.com  -> New project
#  2. Paste the code from apps-script-webhook.gs (in this repo) and save.
#  3. Set the SHEET_ID constant at the top to your Google Sheet's ID
#     (the long string between /d/ and /edit in the sheet URL).
#  4. Deploy -> New deployment -> Type: "Web app".
#       Execute as: Me
#       Who has access: Anyone
#  5. Authorize once when prompted. Copy the resulting /exec URL here.

VITE_WEBHOOK_URL=
